## Optimization Strategies

### Image Downsampling

```text
640×480 → 320×240
```

Reduces neural inference workload significantly.

### Vectorized Processing

Avoid Python loops.

Example:

```python
positions += velocity_field[
    positions[:,1],
    positions[:,0]
] * alpha
```

### Memory Pooling

- Pre-allocated arrays
- Reduced garbage collection
- Stable frame timing

